  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the chickpeas well and shake off the water. Put them in a large bowl.",
    "Add the cucumber, tomatoes, red onion, and olives to the bowl.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk the olive oil, lemon juice, oregano, garlic, salt, and pepper until smooth.",
    "Pour the dressing over the salad. Toss until every piece is coated.",
    "Let the salad sit for 5 minutes so the onion softens and the flavors blend.",
    "Taste and add more salt or lemon juice if needed. Divide among 4 bowls."
